      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCTF001-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法所称**银行承兑汇票业务**，是指本行作为承兑人，在客户（出票人）签发汇票后予以承兑，并承诺在汇票到期日无条件付款的业务行为。",
      "quoteHash": "d3908d3db291f8b8645d9dcdca5978a2c8ffb097ae1cfa027e2ba42563fae08c",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1ac1446e84b4766b0493d14a13ded2548dbdd614b303ef3996fe5d57f0eec6d2",
      "sourceId": "SRC-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-TF-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCTF001-20260922-1ac1446e",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCTF001-a4c9e1f3",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCTF001-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "办理本业务应遵循\"真实交易、额度控制、敞口可测、票据要件完整\"原则。",
      "quoteHash": "a4c9e1f31bfe4667a614533debc66f678ac30ea63648c410f071aebf5b401355",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1ac1446e84b4766b0493d14a13ded2548dbdd614b303ef3996fe5d57f0eec6d2",
      "sourceId": "SRC-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-TF-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCTF001-20260922-1ac1446e",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCTF001-3be30f7f",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2922ed36",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCTF001-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "申请承兑的客户应同时满足：一、依法登记且在本行开立结算账户；二、内部评级不低于本行对公承兑业务准入线（见 `SRC-XFAM-001`）；三、与交易对手存在**真实交易背景**（核验按 `SRC-TF-003`）；四、无重大票据违约或不良信用记录。",
      "quoteHash": "3be30f7f11d5b2e8b2475dba131e0151792202714ade14832aa50de1bc2e847d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T20:05:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1ac1446e84b4766b0493d14a13ded2548dbdd614b303ef3996fe5d57f0eec6d2",
      "sourceId": "SRC-TF-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-TF-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCTF001-20260922-1ac1446e",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
